{"body":{"model":"opus","reads":{"$ref":"01M6S09BX5DDBXFS8D3EQZG0QR"},"seedFrom":"inside","top":{"$ref":"01M6S74NH2D1P5XGA9CDA0NCWP"},"understandings":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NH2D1P5XGA9CDA0NCWP"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NH3YSP0KD9ZCE27YDXH"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NH4E4GB23TNHK4ZP2KY"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NH5YBTMFYWMZJ3FA13X"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NH6HS1PA4K18TSEZ48S"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NH7YZ5GTMT9JJKBNW0Z"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NH8M1BCA9F2S91RQWXZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NH9EB9HH5S4GB040K0Z"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NHAGNSZPCWHQQ4R8NXX"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NHB1XJ3QTC9ZWQ50M1C"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NHCVH280K4RJ2VN9FBG"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NHD1ZY5CV46BNQR3QVK"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NHE7QGWP46CB0H7240Q"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NHF0YMFA4SH3BXX8JPQ"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NHGJC4EMD3TEEFWQ32V"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NHHG70CFVJ4EJ5W3Z4H"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NHJ5SEFPJKVNARYS9VC"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NHK35M0K86TM54632YW"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NHM995HZRS6S807B22C"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NHNKR6QN7XVJ4FBD926"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NHPN556R78VBVMXWZZJ"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NHQX4EVGHTBXER25EQZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NHRHVCN3M6C1CVVW5T3"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NHS13BMT33B47KYHYM0"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NHTAAFSCKZ2NJ2WYFWH"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NHV2CV456Q85W8NXG15"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NHWPH3DZN3NEMDN4R0B"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NHX6PK5423GHXK1YEK6"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NHYV17C2FDA5D72RXBQ"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NHZB6Q8RM2FC8EEZG78"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NJ0ZTB0E4HTA4FZN4EK"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NJ1QCXP58NJQDPZ919J"}]},"id":"01M6S74NJ2RB34JRNVY0QTXPGG","instance":["01M6S74NG0JR8Q2S499AF7FR71"],"kind":"version","name":"branch-02","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the balance between a part's self-keeping and its being directed","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NH3YSP0KD9ZCE27YDXH"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NH4E4GB23TNHK4ZP2KY"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NH5YBTMFYWMZJ3FA13X"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NJ1QCXP58NJQDPZ919J"}],"prose":"Everything in this space circles one balance: how much of itself a part may keep while something larger coordinates it. The answer is given as distribution of authority, yet a single highest holder keeps coming back, and the text itself shows the strain of holding so many pieces together.","title":"Keeping oneself while being held"},"id":"01M6S74NH2D1P5XGA9CDA0NCWP","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"where decision lives","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NH6HS1PA4K18TSEZ48S"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NH9EB9HH5S4GB040K0Z"}],"prose":"Before anything is built, the space settles what kind of thing a holon is and where order in a system of them comes from.","title":"What a part is and who decides"},"id":"01M6S74NH3YSP0KD9ZCE27YDXH","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the double standing of each part","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NH7YZ5GTMT9JJKBNW0Z"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NH8M1BCA9F2S91RQWXZ"}],"prose":"A holon is defined by being simultaneously self-standing and contained, which separates it from a free agent and gives it a place in a nested order.","title":"The part that is also a whole"},"id":"01M6S74NH6HS1PA4K18TSEZ48S","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"constraint by position","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S08ZK9JNT733QPVPKKPB33"},{"$ref":"01M6S08ZQJDTPV1K5MVEQB7EKC"},{"$ref":"01M6S08ZT4PVPYCGQYJV7PR3M5"},{"$ref":"01M6S092GHEZCKHBE4ZKEW3J78"},{"$ref":"01M6S0932TYVDNG7V3F9FPTYPQ"}],"prose":"Holons are set beside agents and kept apart from them by rank: an agent roams a flat field, a holon answers to the level above.","title":"Not quite an agent"},"id":"01M6S74NH7YZ5GTMT9JJKBNW0Z","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the breadth of domains reached","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S08YR2M952H7ZN6R90BBJZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S08YV85BZVM4G694CQKMYX"},{"$ref":"01M6S08ZXGVT2TSASGV9X2TYHX"},{"$ref":"01M6S090806VNZVA97AV0V0XD2"},{"$ref":"01M6S090GX8FSDRJ0E4TJ1H3DX"},{"$ref":"01M6S090KZCM15DWJFKQVKT5TM"},{"$ref":"01M6S090PDBF0YZFN6YMV9WJ5W"}],"prose":"The idea travels from a philosopher's coinage to manufacturing cells, then to grids, buildings and data pipelines, gaining generality as it moves.","title":"A lineage leaving the factory"},"id":"01M6S74NH8M1BCA9F2S91RQWXZ","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the direction order flows","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NHAGNSZPCWHQQ4R8NXX"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NHB1XJ3QTC9ZWQ50M1C"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NHCVH280K4RJ2VN9FBG"}],"prose":"Order is described two ways at once: rising from many small interactions, and handed down by a top with the most authority; the space never fully chooses.","title":"Where order comes from"},"id":"01M6S74NH9EB9HH5S4GB040K0Z","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"emergence without a controller","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S08ZQJDTPV1K5MVEQB7EKC"},{"$ref":"01M6S092GHEZCKHBE4ZKEW3J78"},{"$ref":"01M6S0916BHS51YPSAGK594MMT"},{"$ref":"01M6S0919HQTTW5K4S0JD9BAN6"},{"$ref":"01M6S091CAZDYVGXTAQ2RARAAA"},{"$ref":"01M6S0957APBWA2W6N7RK4HA1J"}],"prose":"Simple individual rules yielding large patterns, and coordination emerging without a centre, are the inheritance the proposal claims.","title":"Order rising from below"},"id":"01M6S74NHAGNSZPCWHQQ4R8NXX","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"autonomy preserved under cooperation","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S08YN14HRJCEVFSBB1SNPM"},{"$ref":"01M6S095E1M1ENNRVMHW352873"},{"$ref":"01M6S095RQV1YWJ0PTP40VJPNM"},{"$ref":"01M6S095WN23Y8DRJGK8C24NJV"},{"$ref":"01M6S096SSRKHN58F6YBT2PD3S"},{"$ref":"01M6S0997JNB7G6FJ23GTB226M"},{"$ref":"01M6S099B342ME391EQMJR2ENW"},{"$ref":"01M6S099H77DWSEH2T534Q8NP8"}],"prose":"Repeatedly the federation is said to work with no central control and no imposed structure on its members.","title":"The promise of no centre"},"id":"01M6S74NHB1XJ3QTC9ZWQ50M1C","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"who holds final say","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S08ZK9JNT733QPVPKKPB33"},{"$ref":"01M6S09710AV583QD1MPBPW32H"},{"$ref":"01M6S0978GWDT0ZWN8XT22K2EJ"},{"$ref":"01M6S0988S3MZFMVE7H1RCZSJZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A5WEFJY26M01RF4RE1F"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AG184GYEQ79ZCXADC7B"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AXT9RAEXAGQP942K710"},{"$ref":"01M6S09B0KJPXKB931FZC1JHE3"}],"prose":"The binder is named superholon, orchestrator, highest authority; it restructures workflows and others defer to it, so the pyramid reappears inside the federation.","title":"Authority returning at the top"},"id":"01M6S74NHCVH280K4RJ2VN9FBG","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"what crosses a boundary between parts","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NHD1ZY5CV46BNQR3QVK"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NHHG70CFVJ4EJ5W3Z4H"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NHPN556R78VBVMXWZZJ"}],"prose":"Once parts are allowed to differ, three things have to cross between them: meaning, judgement split into roles, and a binding apparatus that carries both.","title":"What must pass between parts"},"id":"01M6S74NH4E4GB23TNHK4ZP2KY","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"how meaning survives a crossing","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NHE7QGWP46CB0H7240Q"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NHF0YMFA4SH3BXX8JPQ"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NHGJC4EMD3TEEFWQ32V"}],"prose":"Parts built by different hands speak differently; the space treats bridging their meaning as the core difficulty.","title":"Meaning across difference"},"id":"01M6S74NHD1ZY5CV46BNQR3QVK","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"how much sameness is demanded","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S095GRG93K5EG2K71B1CKV"},{"$ref":"01M6S095HBYZ649HND3ZYXDXYT"},{"$ref":"01M6S095HYCF58A43XBQ8GAQ7Q"},{"$ref":"01M6S095KGFWMBWNW19K2CKDZC"},{"$ref":"01M6S095NRWBNYWJEQPXGFXTC5"},{"$ref":"01M6S095PBA4ZRBXY1GY14VWHR"},{"$ref":"01M6S095Q6V5YHG5EJ40PT2KHP"},{"$ref":"01M6S095RQV1YWJ0PTP40VJPNM"},{"$ref":"01M6S099046TN4NZCBCFH60P0M"}],"prose":"Incompatibilities are sorted by kind and concern, and the ways across range from one shared format to none at all.","title":"Barriers and three ways across"},"id":"01M6S74NHE7QGWP46CB0H7240Q","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the lifespan of an agreement","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S09654M23DFDXTHS52MBXA"},{"$ref":"01M6S097JQCMENMDG4DXR4V4ZJ"},{"$ref":"01M6S097N1AM8EGG88P63ZS8D9"},{"$ref":"01M6S0992KZHB02ZBDX260T244"}],"prose":"Instead of a lasting shared vocabulary, small vocabularies are made for a task, used, and discarded, so agreement is temporary and situated.","title":"Meaning made to expire"},"id":"01M6S74NHF0YMFA4SH3BXX8JPQ","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"reliance on encoded knowledge","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S08Z79ESR6PT11B13KVPB3"},{"$ref":"01M6S093AKQX05TGPX6C9SX1YG"},{"$ref":"01M6S093YQ6AXJZ5BM1HF4WFQX"},{"$ref":"01M6S0941499S7BC44BDW6VFZ3"},{"$ref":"01M6S09474K3F10PRDVM1JZJ06"},{"$ref":"01M6S0949YC2RGE7SVC8VQ2BJA"},{"$ref":"01M6S094DC83NRPYHDHCDK6Z0T"},{"$ref":"01M6S094H6M3N8CRFWQ98BWV6P"},{"$ref":"01M6S098NTTHF9ESCJ8CYMNPR9"},{"$ref":"01M6S098YF407XTYGG61RBEPZ7"},{"$ref":"01M6S09BX3RAPV03PXJHMR2Z5K"}],"prose":"Ethics, understanding, bias and translation are each to be handled by writing down a structured vocabulary, which makes vocabulary-building the recurring unpaid cost.","title":"Ontology as the answer to everything"},"id":"01M6S74NHGJC4EMD3TEEFWQ32V","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"which aspect of a decision a role guards","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NHJ5SEFPJKVNARYS9VC"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NHK35M0K86TM54632YW"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NHM995HZRS6S807B22C"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NHNKR6QN7XVJ4FBD926"}],"prose":"What a single conscientious decider would do is split among specialised parts, each guarding one aspect of a good decision.","title":"Judgement divided into roles"},"id":"01M6S74NHHG70CFVJ4EJ5W3Z4H","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"what a decision is not allowed to be","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S093679WVYX9W76WMQSFYF"},{"$ref":"01M6S093AKQX05TGPX6C9SX1YG"},{"$ref":"01M6S093C3FHWQ6C5YRWRHZ9BN"},{"$ref":"01M6S093D1G6HQ1AF4PPZ6Z3M4"},{"$ref":"01M6S093FSPTEATFTYCNEJEMQ4"},{"$ref":"01M6S0949YC2RGE7SVC8VQ2BJA"},{"$ref":"01M6S094DC83NRPYHDHCDK6Z0T"},{"$ref":"01M6S094EZEHMWPGCTN09CMTBK"},{"$ref":"01M6S094G14MVA149MAHGZ3JBG"},{"$ref":"01M6S094H6M3N8CRFWQ98BWV6P"},{"$ref":"01M6S094K282XW4C3DANB6FYG7"},{"$ref":"01M6S0974ESZ3BC4PQGRAQ140D"},{"$ref":"01M6S0976Z3XG1JS1A2VTTTBZN"}],"prose":"Two roles act as brakes: one checks right and wrong, the other checks unfair leaning, each by rules and audits wrapped around the act.","title":"Restraints on a decision"},"id":"01M6S74NHJ5SEFPJKVNARYS9VC","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"how far ahead consequences are counted","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S093JWWSFCKGZGR3EF21M7"},{"$ref":"01M6S093NFQRR88X9PD990GSFB"},{"$ref":"01M6S093PESAZNQ254MP8QMHMG"},{"$ref":"01M6S093W4DZ6B9GKDGMNA5DED"}],"prose":"Doing a thing quickly is set against doing it with its later consequences counted, and the hard part is measuring the later.","title":"The horizon of a goal"},"id":"01M6S74NHK35M0K86TM54632YW","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the reach of what a part perceives","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S093YQ6AXJZ5BM1HF4WFQX"},{"$ref":"01M6S0941499S7BC44BDW6VFZ3"},{"$ref":"01M6S0943RC500MSJR3TQ6FQP3"},{"$ref":"01M6S0944TNASX9K8JK5V5RTRP"},{"$ref":"01M6S094NQQR6J9EGV6K49FTZS"},{"$ref":"01M6S094QH86CGJ2VPFEPRMBRA"},{"$ref":"01M6S094RFB8ZYRDV9DDW98ERX"},{"$ref":"01M6S094SYAEG8KEJ8AW61YRGQ"},{"$ref":"01M6S094VHECP7DNYBAFKGW3ZP"},{"$ref":"01M6S094XMKX1YC7SH2K1A4ZDZ"}],"prose":"Two roles face outward: one interprets data into a picture, the other watches across levels so that parts informed of their own corner stay aligned with the whole.","title":"Seeing the situation"},"id":"01M6S74NHM995HZRS6S807B22C","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the flow between roles","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S094Z5HFC2AJXX9P288K6H"},{"$ref":"01M6S0950DPJQCE6FKYH7TSD58"},{"$ref":"01M6S0951AZ5JE4ABRCQSXWQ2F"},{"$ref":"01M6S0953BG3WSGDTSRPS30552"},{"$ref":"01M6S0953C5H9DMB8CRTPS6YK3"},{"$ref":"01M6S097S811FX4ENN201BA6PM"},{"$ref":"01M6S097VCBK9XZ25KFJF0ND5N"}],"prose":"The roles are not independent: checks feed the balancer, interpretation feeds both, and the watcher sits over all, so negotiation between them is needed.","title":"Roles feeding one another"},"id":"01M6S74NHNKR6QN7XVJ4FBD926","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"how a binder is built","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NHQX4EVGHTBXER25EQZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NHRHVCN3M6C1CVVW5T3"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NHS13BMT33B47KYHYM0"}],"prose":"The thing that holds the parts together is itself a composite, with organs for reasoning, recording, finding, translating, planning and executing.","title":"The binding apparatus"},"id":"01M6S74NHPN556R78VBVMXWZZJ","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"what is trusted to reason","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S0988S3MZFMVE7H1RCZSJZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S098ECD82QGT0KGXZG1EAS"}],"prose":"The deciding and translating organs are given to a large language model, trusted for rational choice and for adapting to unseen inputs.","title":"A reasoner at the centre"},"id":"01M6S74NHQX4EVGHTBXER25EQZ","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the record of possible connections","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S098BNS851MZHX3SFT2NYC"},{"$ref":"01M6S098FH9YH6FMBTFF272DJA"},{"$ref":"01M6S098GRA69D8E61BGJ3ETJF"},{"$ref":"01M6S098HDWNMXMGHDKP7HYH0G"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A2TPJHK2PYS75HJWY0Y"}],"prose":"Every new element is recorded in a graph of capabilities and links, which is then searched to assemble a path from request to answer.","title":"A map of what can connect to what"},"id":"01M6S74NHRHVCN3M6C1CVVW5T3","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the dial of granted autonomy","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S0982Y69VFJ6C8NQBP89NE"},{"$ref":"01M6S098M0RG9CGW3VBAQ8E35X"},{"$ref":"01M6S098WFFJ09R57JCXQAZAM3"},{"$ref":"01M6S098Q89NK293FCZ3EYNTNC"}],"prose":"Its autonomy is adjustable: remove the planning and executing organs and it only governs, it no longer connects.","title":"How much the binder may act"},"id":"01M6S74NHS13BMT33B47KYHYM0","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the distance between enacting and showing","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NHV2CV456Q85W8NXG15"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NHWPH3DZN3NEMDN4R0B"}],"prose":"The proposal is tested not by measurement but by enactment: a simulation that may steer itself, and a countryside cast as a stage.","title":"How the whole is tried"},"id":"01M6S74NH5YBTMFYWMZJ3FA13X","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"whether participants direct their own trial","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S091PP1ZZQG6WZ7R3BMA7Q"},{"$ref":"01M6S091YM28K8SWNXGQD94QWR"},{"$ref":"01M6S092GHEZCKHBE4ZKEW3J78"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NHTAAFSCKZ2NJ2WYFWH"},{"$ref":"01M6S09BPKS0KGT7SR4GE75ACB"},{"$ref":"01M6S092VYEKZR8236TWY9GTNW"}],"prose":"An inherited taxonomy of agents and simulation is carried over to holons, adding the claim that participants may direct the very run they are in.","title":"A simulation that directs itself"},"id":"01M6S74NHV2CV456Q85W8NXG15","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"how much a participant shapes the process","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S092KE6ZMECGQSSQBF90BV"},{"$ref":"01M6S092MRCB5DHW2QJWZCMH6P"},{"$ref":"01M6S092NT1X7H7BGXEJM161WB"},{"$ref":"01M6S092PS96FXNTYW0G07YCMZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S092QP2J2DR6DJZ6E197EW"},{"$ref":"01M6S092RHVP4CPW8DAZR8Q3QP"},{"$ref":"01M6S092RXW7KF4BQKGGRPEJTG"}],"prose":"Holons in simulation are ranked by how much they act on the run itself, from mere source of data to rewriting the rules.","title":"Steering by degrees"},"id":"01M6S74NHTAAFSCKZ2NJ2WYFWH","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"how the general is cast into the particular","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NHX6PK5423GHXK1YEK6"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NHYV17C2FDA5D72RXBQ"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NHZB6Q8RM2FC8EEZG78"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NJ0ZTB0E4HTA4FZN4EK"}],"prose":"The rural case gives the architecture actors and a purpose, and is itself split between finding absence, casting roles, mirroring them in simulation, and stating what follows.","title":"A countryside as stage"},"id":"01M6S74NHWPH3DZN3NEMDN4R0B","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the visibility of absence","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S099H77DWSEH2T534Q8NP8"},{"$ref":"01M6S099P1AJBBMKJ6BC76WM36"},{"$ref":"01M6S099QDK964CYS5R06EN4WT"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AG184GYEQ79ZCXADC7B"}],"prose":"The most distinctive aim is to locate places without transport, so the system's watching is turned toward gaps rather than flows.","title":"Finding where nothing runs"},"id":"01M6S74NHX6PK5423GHXK1YEK6","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"which actor carries which role","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S099K16DKC7EQQ35ANCYXH"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A2TPJHK2PYS75HJWY0Y"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A2VW9MCRGFVA05NDNK8"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A3Q6P77FKPS24YHHCNW"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A5BW0BNN3HVZ12K0BPE"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A5WEFJY26M01RF4RE1F"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AB69C8H307DTGBZQJX3"}],"prose":"Travellers, transport services, infrastructure and communication each take on one of the abstract roles, and the binder opens and closes the sequence.","title":"Roles cast as actors"},"id":"01M6S74NHYV17C2FDA5D72RXBQ","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the fidelity between rehearsal and system","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S099RX7Z7ZGC575Z0RX8W5"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AH0YMYNDBY3FA44T68F"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AH1PWXPQSYN6X82S0CZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AXT9RAEXAGQP942K710"},{"$ref":"01M6S09B0KJPXKB931FZC1JHE3"},{"$ref":"01M6S09B4PEE2MM0G40XAMDENJ"}],"prose":"The simulation duplicates each acting holon as a federate under a manager that is itself a subordinate copy of the binder, so the test is a mirror of the system it tests.","title":"A twin rehearsal"},"id":"01M6S74NHZB6Q8RM2FC8EEZG78","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the gap between claim and evidence","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S09BAGXSGTE19VJ36NDS5M"},{"$ref":"01M6S09BD7Q7DNEGX5EB0MJ8HK"},{"$ref":"01M6S09BEWR9X5Z7H9RYYS9WNB"},{"$ref":"01M6S09BKTDMZ0B76G7C8BX946"},{"$ref":"01M6S09BX3RAPV03PXJHMR2Z5K"}],"prose":"Scalability, fairness and lower emissions are stated as results, while the close concedes there is no empirical validation yet.","title":"Benefit asserted, proof deferred"},"id":"01M6S74NJ0ZTB0E4HTA4FZN4EK","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
